bgs --worktree login: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `bgs fork`, `bgs exec`, and `bgs exec fork`
bgs fork --worktree: `bgs fork --worktree` requires an explicit session ID
bgs fork --worktree --last: `bgs fork --worktree` requires an explicit session ID
bgs exec resume --worktree session: `--worktree` cannot resume an existing session; use `bgs exec fork --worktree`
bgs exec review --worktree: `--worktree` is not supported for code review
bgs resume --worktree session: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `bgs fork`, `bgs exec`, and `bgs exec fork`
bgs archive session --worktree: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `bgs fork`, `bgs exec`, and `bgs exec fork`
bgs queue --thread session --message hi --worktree: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `bgs fork`, `bgs exec`, and `bgs exec fork`
